		{
			"id": "srzy3608",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 6544.890505527712,
			"y": 373.0360602753235,
			"width": 570.29296875,
			"height": 425,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#ffffff",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b19",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 538158418,
			"version": 378,
			"versionNonce": 678674706,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772816492333,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "given a binary string `s`without leading zeros, return `true`if\n`s`contains at most one contiguous segment of ones. Otherwise,\nreturn `false`.\n\ne.g. 1\ninput: s = \"1001\"\noutput: false\nexplanation: the ones do not form a contiguous segment\n\ne.g. 2\ninput s = \"110\"\noutput: true\n\nconstraints:\n- 1 <= s.lenght <= 100\n- s[i] is either \"0\" or \"1\"\n- s[0] is \"1\"",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "given a binary string `s`without leading zeros, return `true`if\n`s`contains at most one contiguous segment of ones. Otherwise,\nreturn `false`.\n\ne.g. 1\ninput: s = \"1001\"\noutput: false\nexplanation: the ones do not form a contiguous segment\n\ne.g. 2\ninput s = \"110\"\noutput: true\n\nconstraints:\n- 1 <= s.lenght <= 100\n- s[i] is either \"0\" or \"1\"\n- s[0] is \"1\"",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "Wv2Zpysx",
