			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "e.g. 1\ninput: n = 5\noutput: 2\nexplanation: the integer `5` is `101` in binary and its complement\nis `010` which is the integer `2`.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "e.g. 1\ninput: n = 5\noutput: 2\nexplanation: the integer `5` is `101` in binary and its complement\nis `010` which is the integer `2`.",
