			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "currentLineWidth = 8, 11, 16, 15, 16\n- forget about inserting spaces after words,\njust insert the space at the same time\n- we reached maxWidth with a space, so we remove the last\nspace\n- and add spaces until maxWidth is reached\n- we can't add even spaces, so we must do with odd\n- currentLineWidth = maxWidth, add line to the output and continue ",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "currentLineWidth = 8, 11, 16, 15, 16\n- forget about inserting spaces after words,\njust insert the space at the same time\n- we reached maxWidth with a space, so we remove the last\nspace\n- and add spaces until maxWidth is reached\n- we can't add even spaces, so we must do with odd\n- currentLineWidth = maxWidth, add line to the output and continue ",
