			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1. look for a 1\n    1.1. expand on all directions until a 0 is found\n    1.2. once no 1s can be found, increment the island counter\n\n2. keep looking for 1s in unvisited cells",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "1. look for a 1\n    1.1. expand on all directions until a 0 is found\n    1.2. once no 1s can be found, increment the island counter\n\n2. keep looking for 1s in unvisited cells",
