			"updated": 1774574373089,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Given an array of strings strs, group the anagrams together.\nYou can return the answer in any order.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Given an array of strings strs, group the anagrams together.\nYou can return the answer in any order.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "8RgO0jEQ",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 7782.928325393042,
			"y": 8758.873383150607,
			"width": 600.966796875,
			"height": 350,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#ffffff",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bMD",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 276121641,
			"version": 165,
			"versionNonce": 206123018,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1774574373089,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Example 1:\n\nInput: strs = [\"eat\",\"tea\",\"tan\",\"ate\",\"nat\",\"bat\"]\n\nOutput: [[\"bat\"],[\"nat\",\"tan\"],[\"ate\",\"eat\",\"tea\"]]\n\nExplanation:\n\nThere is no string in strs that can be rearranged to form \"bat\".\nThe strings \"nat\" and \"tan\" are anagrams as they can be rearranged\nto form each other.\nThe strings \"ate\", \"eat\", and \"tea\" are anagrams as they can be\nrearranged to form each other.\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Example 1:\n\nInput: strs = [\"eat\",\"tea\",\"tan\",\"ate\",\"nat\",\"bat\"]\n\nOutput: [[\"bat\"],[\"nat\",\"tan\"],[\"ate\",\"eat\",\"tea\"]]\n\nExplanation:\n\nThere is no string in strs that can be rearranged to form \"bat\".\nThe strings \"nat\" and \"tan\" are anagrams as they can be rearranged\nto form each other.\nThe strings \"ate\", \"eat\", and \"tea\" are anagrams as they can be\nrearranged to form each other.\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
