			"text": "def solve(problem):\n    # BASE CASE: stop recursion\n    if is_small_enough(problem):\n        return base_case_solution(problem)\n\n    # DIVIDE: split into sub-problems\n    left, right = divide(problem)\n\n    # CONQUER: recurse on each part\n    left_sol = solve(left)\n    right_sol = solve(right)\n\n    # COMBINE: merge sub-solutions\n    return combine(left_sol, right_sol)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "def solve(problem):\n    # BASE CASE: stop recursion\n    if is_small_enough(problem):\n        return base_case_solution(problem)\n\n    # DIVIDE: split into sub-problems\n    left, right = divide(problem)\n\n    # CONQUER: recurse on each part\n    left_sol = solve(left)\n    right_sol = solve(right)\n\n    # COMBINE: merge sub-solutions\n    return combine(left_sol, right_sol)",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
