			"seed": 729931786,
			"version": 20,
			"versionNonce": 1514765450,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1774735365778,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "You are given a 0-indexed array of integers nums of length n.\nYou are initially positioned at index 0.\n\nEach element nums[i] represents the maximum length of a\nforward jump from index i. In other words, if you are at index i,\nyou can jump to any index (i + j) where:\n\n- 0 <= j <= nums[i] and\n- i + j < n\n\nReturn the minimum number of jumps to reach index n - 1.\nThe test cases are generated such that you can reach index n - 1.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "You are given a 0-indexed array of integers nums of length n.\nYou are initially positioned at index 0.\n\nEach element nums[i] represents the maximum length of a\nforward jump from index i. In other words, if you are at index i,\nyou can jump to any index (i + j) where:\n\n- 0 <= j <= nums[i] and\n- i + j < n\n\nReturn the minimum number of jumps to reach index n - 1.\nThe test cases are generated such that you can reach index n - 1.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "jm93UtZu",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -3.61522284994642,
			"y": 14814.974532637038,
			"width": 592.509765625,
			"height": 150,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#ffffff",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bPf",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1717735626,
			"version": 6,
			"versionNonce": 1023201930,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1774735387559,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Example 1:\n\nInput: nums = [2,3,1,1,4]\nOutput: 2\nExplanation: The minimum number of jumps to reach the last index\nis 2. Jump 1 step from index 0 to 1, then 3 steps to the last index.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Example 1:\n\nInput: nums = [2,3,1,1,4]\nOutput: 2\nExplanation: The minimum number of jumps to reach the last index\nis 2. Jump 1 step from index 0 to 1, then 3 steps to the last index.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
