			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Given a sorted array of distinct integers and a target value,\nreturn the index if the target is found. If not, return the index\nwhere it would be if it were inserted in order.\n\nYou must write an algorithm with O(log n) runtime complexity.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Given a sorted array of distinct integers and a target value,\nreturn the index if the target is found. If not, return the index\nwhere it would be if it were inserted in order.\n\nYou must write an algorithm with O(log n) runtime complexity.",
